    "body": "This PR catches four birds with one stone:\n\n- fixes https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/issues/36515\n- add a new `getTotalFees()` getter so IPC clients don't have to sum up individual transaction fees\n- storing fees in `m_total_fees` simplifies the `WaitAndCreateNewBlock` implementation.\n- make it easier to add fee info to (future) external templates, as requested in    https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/35671#issuecomment-6065004542\n\nThe last commit contains the fix for #36515, which is made easier by the changes before it. However if this PR doesn't make it, I'll open a fresh one with a direct fix.",
